-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρτάμωνος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Ἀρτάμωνος\">Ἀρτάμων(ος)\u003C/span>\u003C/span> – &gt; \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.)\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al3-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"μηδὲ\">μηδὲ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"ὑπὲρ\">ὑπὲρ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Εὕριος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Εὕριος\">Εὕρ(ιος?)\u003C/span>\u003C/span> – \u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.)\u003C/span>  \u003Cbr id=\"al4-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.)\u003C/span> Λ̣Ε̣ \u003Cbr id=\"al5-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.)\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"κατ\">κατ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρτά                \n                    μωνα\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Ἀρτά                \n                    μωνα\">Ἀρτά̣- sign, uninterpreted\u003Cbr id=\"al6-interpretive\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span>\u003Cspan dir=\"ltr\">(vac.)\u003C/span>μωνα\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/div>  \u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 reg., orig. ΠΥΡΟΝΠύρον\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Savannah Neibart\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-diplomatic\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-diplomatic\">\u003Ca id=\"al1-diplomatic\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΠύρονΠύρρον\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΠύρονΠύρρον\">ΠΥΡ.Ν\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"καἴ\">ΚΑΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"τι\">ΤΙ\u003C/span>\u003Cbr id=\"al2-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">2\u003C/span>Δ\u003Cspan data-text=\"ὑπὲρ\">ΥΠΕΡ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρτάμωνος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Ἀρτάμωνος\">ΑΡΤΑΜΩΝ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>–&gt;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003Cbr id=\"al3-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">3\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"μηδὲ\">ΜΗΔΕ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-text=\"ὑπὲρ\">ΥΠΕΡ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Εὕριος\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"Εὕριος\">ΕΥΡ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>.&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003Cbr id=\"al4-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">4\u003C/span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;..\u003Cbr id=\"al5-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">5\u003C/span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; \u003Cspan data-text=\"κατ\">ΚΑΤ\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"Ἀρτά                \n                    μωνα\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"idionym\" data-text=\"Ἀρτά                \n                    μωνα\">ΑΡΤ.- sign, uninterpreted\u003Cbr id=\"al6-diplomatic\">\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">6\u003C/span> &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;ΜΩΝΑ\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/div>\u003Cp class=\"miniapp\">l.1 reg., orig. ΠΥΡΟΝΠύρον\u003C/p>\u003C/div>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"facsimile-images\">\u003Ch2>Facsimile Images\u003C/h2>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"apparatus\">\u003Ch4>Apparatus criticus\u003C/h4>\u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003Cspan>  \u003Cspan>Text after Bettarini.\u003C/span>  \u003C/span>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>English translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"translation\">\u003Ch2>Italian translation\u003C/h2>\u003Cp class=\"translation-author\">  \u003C/p>\u003Cp>  \u003C/p>\u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"commentary\">\u003Ch2>commentary\u003C/h2>  \u003Cp>The horizontal strokes (LL. 2 and 3) probably denote the abbreviation of the preceding names. The other signs occur in the lines in which the defictus Ἀρτάμων is mentioned: magical signs? (SEG)\u003C/p>  \u003Cp>La peculiarità di questa lamina è la menzione della persona a favore della quale la maledizione viene redatta: Heuris a r.3 è il 'beneficiario' della maledizione. Siamo dunque nell'abituale contesto agonistico delle defixiones greche, contesto di cui è però impossibile in questo caso precisare la natura. (Bettarini)\u003C/p>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"bibliography\">\u003Ch2>bibliography\u003C/h2>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli> Bettarini 2005 5 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10001388\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003Cli> 2005 55.1025 \u003Ca href=\"https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\" target=\"_blank\">https://biblio.inscriptiones.org/epig10000796\u003C/a>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003Cul>\u003Cli>\u003C/li>\u003C/ul>  \u003C/div>  \u003Cdiv id=\"handnote\">  Line 1    \u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"license\"> Licensed under a Creative Commons-Attribution 4.0 licence. \u003C/div>",[192,195,198,201,203,206,209],{"id":193,"html":194},"editions","\u003Cdiv class=\"attribution\">Text encoding: Savannah Neibart\u003C/div>\u003Cdiv id=\"edition-interpretive\" lang=\"grc\">  \u003Cdiv class=\"textpart\" lang=\"grc\">\u003Cspan class=\"ab\" id=\"div-interpretive\">  \u003Ca id=\"al1-interpretive\">\u003C!--0-->\u003C/a>\u003Cspan class=\"linenumber\">1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan data-type=\"persname\" data-name-type=\"attested\" data-text=\"ΠύρονΠύρρον\">\u003Cspan data-type=\"name\" data-name-type=\"\" data-text=\"ΠύρονΠύρρον\">Πύρο̣ν\u003C/span>\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text=\"καἴ\">καἴ\u003C/span>  \u003Cspan data-text